sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P1 as Browser
    participant P2 as Presigned upload
    participant P3 as Quarantine bucket
    participant P4 as Media API/ClamAV
    participant P5 as Decode/transcode
    participant P6 as Private ready bucket
    P1->>P2: Request scoped upload
    P2->>P3: Upload to quarantine
    P3->>P4: Verify bytes / size
    P4->>P5: Scan and transcode
    P5->>P6: Promote private object
    P6-->>P1: Résultat / statut vérifié
